  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "trackName": "Crown Heist: Safe Cracker",
      "description": "Crown Heist is a precision safe-cracking game built exclusively for Apple Watch. Rotate the Digital Crown to crack combination locks and feel every pin click into place through real haptic feedback.\n\nHOW TO PLAY\nTurn the crown slowly to find each pin, then reverse direction, just like a real combination lock. Turn too far past a pin and you lose a life. Lock in every pin before your lives run out, grab the loot and slip away before the cops close in.\n\n• CRACK THE SAFE: locks from simple 2-pin dials to punishing 6-pin vaults with 100 positions\n• HEAR IT AND FEEL IT: fine-tuned, satisfying sound effects with audio on, and deeper, richer haptics that take over in silent mode\n• HEIST 10 AREAS: 250 handcrafted safes guarded by 10 notorious villains, from Barnaby to Regalia\n• DODGE 8 DEVIOUS TRAPS: lasers, blackouts, slime, scrambled dials and more\n• STEAL 168 LOOT ITEMS: from Broken Sunglasses to $250,000 Blackmail Storage, across 6 rarity tiers\n• AN ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK: 11 tracks, with custom music composed for every adventure area\n• DECK OUT YOUR WATCH: custom artwork complications put Crown Heist right on your watch face\n• 3 GAME MODES: Adventure, Endless and two Time Trial variants. Fully playable offline\n• MAKE IT YOURS: 99+ safe skins and unlockable themes\n\nStrap in, crack the code and escape with the loot. The perfect heist fits on your wrist.\n\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://playcrowngames.com/terms/\nPrivacy Policy: https://playcrowngames.com/privacy/",
      "releaseNotes": "Your Royal Pass now unlocks faster across Crown games, and we fixed Restore Purchases getting stuck.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/crown-heist-safe-cracker/id6762077725?uo=4",
